Description: Attach the stress reader before the producer can wrap its ring
 The first drain starts at the oldest retained sample and does not count earlier overwrites.
 Starting the writer first lets it wrap before that drain, invalidating the total-count precondition.
 Attach on the empty page before starting the writer; retain every assertion and the reader contract.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Forwarded: no, to be offered to DisplayXR after their open pull request settles
Last-Update: 2026-11-20

